{
  "id": "unique-event-028",
  "paragraphs": [
    {
      "id": "unique-event-028:p0000",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "#28 - Black mirror ritual\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[87,446,472]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-028:p0001",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "You wait until midnight then you\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[87,472,505]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-028:p0002",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "stare into your black mirror and\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[87,505,538]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-028:p0003",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "repeat the demon’s name three\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[87,538,568]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-028:p0004",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "times. Lose 2 Sanity if you fail a L6\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[87,568,606]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-028:p0005",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Magic roll (add +1 if you have the\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[87,606,641]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-028:p0006",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Occultist Skill and +2 if you have it\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[87,641,679]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-028:p0007",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "at Expert level). Depending on the\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[87,679,714]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-028:p0008",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "demon whose name you have\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[87,714,740]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-028:p0009",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "spoken, your fate will differ.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[87,740,771]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-028:p0010",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Walrus the Clown.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[87,771,789]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-028:p0011",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "The Clown’s mask appears before\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[87,789,821]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-028:p0012",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "you. You may decide to leave it\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[87,821,853]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-028:p0013",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "here, carry it with you, or wear it\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[87,853,889]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-028:p0014",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "(go to event #15). If you already\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[87,889,923]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-028:p0015",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "have the mask, ignore this event.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[87,923,957]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-028:p0016",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Pigface.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[87,957,966]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-028:p0017",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "You fall into the black mirror,\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[87,966,998]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-028:p0018",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "carrying all your equipment with\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[87,998,1031]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-028:p0019",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "you. You are now in front of a\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[87,1031,1062]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-028:p0020",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "farm. Go to #5.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[87,1062,1078]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-028:p0021",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Shax.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[87,1078,1084]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-028:p0022",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "A demon with a crane’s head\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[87,1084,1112]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-028:p0023",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "appears in the mirror and agrees\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[87,1112,1145]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-028:p0024",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "to fulfill one wish. You may find\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[87,1145,1179]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-028:p0025",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "any one object of your choice from\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[87,1179,1214]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-028:p0026",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "the Random Object table, Useful\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[87,1214,1246]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-028:p0027",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Stuff table or from the Random\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[87,1246,1277]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-028:p0028",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Magic Item table. After this, Shax\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[87,1277,1312]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-028:p0029",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "disappears. You may not summon\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[87,1312,1343]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-028:p0030",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "him again.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[87,1343,1354]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-028:p0031",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Flauros.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[87,1354,1363]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-028:p0032",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "A leopard-faced man appears in\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[87,1363,1394]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-028:p0033",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "the mirror and proposes a deal. If\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[87,1394,1429]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-028:p0034",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "you reveal the location of two Safe\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[87,1429,1465]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-028:p0035",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Houses and at least one church\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[87,1465,1496]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-028:p0036",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "(you must have visited them),\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[87,1496,1526]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-028:p0037",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Flauros will teach you the Good\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[87,1526,1558]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-028:p0038",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Shot and Fighter Skills for free (you\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[87,1558,1596]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-028:p0039",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "do not have to pay any XP) and\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[87,1596,1627]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-028:p0040",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "heal up to 6 Life. Delete the Safe\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[87,1627,1662]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-028:p0041",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Houses and church from your",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[87,1662,1689]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-028:p0042",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "map. Roll on the Haunted Houses\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[88,22,54]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-028:p0043",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "table if you visit those areas.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[88,54,86]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-028:p0044",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "The demon of Hunger.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[88,86,107]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-028:p0045",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "If you sacrifice at least 6 Food\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[88,107,140]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-028:p0046",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "points to him, he will heal all Sanity\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[88,140,179]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-028:p0047",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "and wounds losses you suffered.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[88,179,211]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-028:p0048",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "He will give you a book of your\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[88,211,243]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-028:p0049",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "choice from the Random Book\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[88,243,271]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-028:p0050",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "table.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[88,271,278]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-028:p0051",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "If you do not have enough Food,\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[88,278,310]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-028:p0052",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "the demon will attack you. If you\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[88,310,344]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-028:p0053",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "defeat him, you will gain 1 XP and\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[88,344,379]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-028:p0054",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "a +1 to all saves vs. Fear until the\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[88,379,416]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-028:p0055",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "end of the campaign.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[88,416,437]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-028:p0056",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Demon of Hunger, L5 Demon,  8\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[88,437,467]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-028:p0057",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Life, damage 2. Vulnerable to\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[88,467,497]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-028:p0058",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Exorcism and holy water.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[88,497,522]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-028:p0059",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "If you are severely wounded (you\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[88,522,555]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-028:p0060",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "have lost more than 5 Life) when\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[88,555,588]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-028:p0061",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "you meet this demon, he will also\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[88,588,622]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-028:p0062",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "strike first in the ensuing combat.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[88,622,658]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-028:p0063",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Other names\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[88,658,670]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-028:p0064",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "The ritual has no effect.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[88,670,696]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-028:p0065",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Every ritual may be repeated only\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[88,696,730]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "unique-event-028:p0066",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "once in the campaign.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[88,730,752]]"
    }
  ],
  "sourcePages": [
    87,
    88
  ]
}
